{
    "title": "Ice Scream 6 Friends: Charlie",
    "description": "In the previous chapter J. collaborated with Mike to help him escape from the engine room and meet in the control room. However, there are still 2 friends to rescue, and it seems they have already found the next one, this time inside the factory\u2019s kitchen.\r\n\r\nIn this new installment you will play as Charlie, who is still lost in the factory and who, with J.'s help, will have to face all the dangers that await him inside the factory. Switch players and go back to being J. whenever you need to. Explore the new parts of the factory in this chapter, meet the new Super Robot in charge of the kitchen, and take on the Mini-Rods and the ice-cream man to get the friends back together.\r\n\r\nSome features:\r\n\u2605 Character switch system: Switch between playing as J. and Charlie, allowing you to discover different areas depending on your character.\r\n\u2605 New enemy: Face the new Super Robot in this chapter. In addition, the Mini Rods are guarding the ice cream factory and will try to prevent you from running away and will alert Rod if they see you. Prove your mastery by dodging and running away from them.\r\n\u2605 Fun puzzles: Solve ingenious puzzles to be reunited with your friends.\r\n\u2605 Mini game: Complete this chapter\u2019s most exciting puzzle in the form of a mini game.\r\n\u2605 Original soundtrack: Immerse yourself in the Ice Scream universe with unique music playing to the beat of the saga and voices recorded exclusively for the game.\r\n\u2605 Hint system: If you get stuck, you have an elaborate hint window at your disposal that\u2019s full of options to help you solve the puzzles based on your playstyle.\r\n\u2605 Various difficulty levels: Play at your own pace and explore safely in ghost mode, or confront Rod and his assistants in the various difficulty levels that will test your skills.\r\n\u2605 A terrifyingly fun game suitable everyone!\r\n \r\nIf you want to enjoy an experience of fantasy, horror and fun, play Ice Scream 6 Friends: Charlie. Action and scares guaranteed.\r\nPlaying with headphones is recommended for the best experience. \r\nLet us know what are your thoughts in the comments!",
    "descriptionHTML": "In the previous chapter J. collaborated with Mike to help him escape from the engine room and meet in the control room. However, there are still 2 friends to rescue, and it seems they have already found the next one, this time inside the factory\u2019s kitchen.<br><br>In this new installment you will play as Charlie, who is still lost in the factory and who, with J.&#39;s help, will have to face all the dangers that await him inside the factory. Switch players and go back to being J. whenever you need to. Explore the new parts of the factory in this chapter, meet the new Super Robot in charge of the kitchen, and take on the Mini-Rods and the ice-cream man to get the friends back together.<br><br>Some features:<br>\u2605 Character switch system: Switch between playing as J. and Charlie, allowing you to discover different areas depending on your character.<br>\u2605 New enemy: Face the new Super Robot in this chapter. In addition, the Mini Rods are guarding the ice cream factory and will try to prevent you from running away and will alert Rod if they see you. Prove your mastery by dodging and running away from them.<br>\u2605 Fun puzzles: Solve ingenious puzzles to be reunited with your friends.<br>\u2605 Mini game: Complete this chapter\u2019s most exciting puzzle in the form of a mini game.<br>\u2605 Original soundtrack: Immerse yourself in the Ice Scream universe with unique music playing to the beat of the saga and voices recorded exclusively for the game.<br>\u2605 Hint system: If you get stuck, you have an elaborate hint window at your disposal that\u2019s full of options to help you solve the puzzles based on your playstyle.<br>\u2605 Various difficulty levels: Play at your own pace and explore safely in ghost mode, or confront Rod and his assistants in the various difficulty levels that will test your skills.<br>\u2605 A terrifyingly fun game suitable everyone!<br> <br>If you want to enjoy an experience of fantasy, horror and fun, play 